n class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060803212828&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Constrictor_0de67a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Thul.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Gaaahhh!</li><li>Boohaa!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quara</a> boss, it looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\">Quara Constrictor</a> but is stronger. It always spawns with 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Hydromancer\">Quara Hydromancers</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Mantassin\">Quara Mantassins</a>, except in the quest room where it spawns alone.\n</p><p>Thul is a boss of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>. The portal which leads to the boss is under the boat of <a href=\"#/wiki/Coral%20Comb\">Coral Comb</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Calassa\">Calassa</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32085,32783,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32085, 32783, 12)</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"585b1f9ddfbd2a9f7edc3d3e7e09f9ea\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Thul3-JPG\" style=\"position: relative; height:90px; width:150px; top:30px;\"><img alt=\"Thul on Candia.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Thul on .\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thul3_7cf731.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Thul3.JPG (61 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Thul on Candia.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Thul-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:150px; top:20.5px;\"><img alt=\"Thul on Luminera Oct. 3, 2010.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Thul on  Oct. 3, 2010.\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thul_e68f4f.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Thul.jpg (191 KB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Thul on Luminera Oct. 3, 2010.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Thul_lair-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:149px; width:140px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"Thul quest room\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Thul quest room\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thul_lair_c89c65.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Thul lair.png (1.2 MB)\" width=\"150\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:150px;\">Thul quest room</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:152px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Krowka383_thul-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:150px;